# Reclamation Sage may target its controller's artifact and decline to destroy it (CR 603.3d, 603.5).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Reclamation Sage
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Reclamation Sage.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby)
Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Types = Artifact
